{"batchcomplete":"","query":{"normalized":[{"from":"White_Beast_Statue","to":"White Beast Statue"}],"pages":{"3020":{"pageid":3020,"ns":0,"title":"White Beast Statue","revisions":[{"revid":50862,"parentid":37293,"slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","*":"{{Sequel Disambiguation}}\n{{Relic Infobox\n|Name        = White Beast Statue\n|Image       = WhiteBeastStatue.png\n|Rarity      = Uncommon\n|Description = [[Potions]] always appear in combat rewards.\n|Flavor      = A small white statue of a creature you have never seen before.\n}}\n{{R|White Beast Statue}} is an {{QueryLink|Relics|rarity:Uncommon|Uncommon}} [[Relic]]. The extra [[Potions|potion]] will be awarded during the combat rewards screen as normal.\n\n== Sources ==\n* Can be dropped by fighting [[Elites]], by buying from the [[Merchant]], or found in a [[Chest]]. See Chest and non-Chest chance at [[Relics#Rarity|Relics > Rarity]].\n* Can be obtained from the relics {{R|Calling Bell}}, {{R|Shovel}}, {{R|Black Star}}, and {{R|Matryoshka}}.\n** {{R|Calling Bell}}'s {{QueryLink|Relics|rarity:Uncommon|Uncommon}} relic can be {{R|White Beast Statue}}.\n** {{R|Matryoshka}}'s extra relic has a 25% chance of being {{QueryLink|Relics|rarity:Uncommon|Uncommon}}, which can be {{R|White Beast Statue}}.\n* Can be obtained from the following [[Events]]:\n** {{E|We Meet Again!}}: Can give {{R|White Beast Statue}} in exchange for either a [[Potion]], some [[Gold]], or a [[Card]].\n** {{E|Wheel of Change}}: Can drop {{R|White Beast Statue}} as a prize.\n** {{E|Big Fish}}: Can give {{R|White Beast Statue}} along with {{C|Regret}}.\n** {{E|Dead Adventurer}}: Either by choosing {{Frame|Search}} and getting {{R|White Beast Statue}} as a reward, or by fighting the [[Elite]] (which can drop {{R|White Beast Statue}}).\n** {{E|Scrap Ooze}}: Can give {{R|White Beast Statue}} with an X% chance, for increasing amounts of damage and likelihood of success on repeated attempts.\n** {{E|Pleading Vagrant}}: Can give {{R|White Beast Statue}} in exchange for either 85 [[Gold]] by choosing {{Frame|Offer Gold}}, or {{C|Shame}} by choosing {{Frame|Rob}}.\n** {{E|The Colosseum}}: The {{Frame|VICTORY}} option drops 1 {{QueryLink|Relics|rarity:Uncommon|Uncommon}} relic (which can be {{R|White Beast Statue}}), and 1 {{QueryLink|Relics|rarity:Rare|Rare}} relic.\n** {{E|The Mausoleum}}: Can give {{R|White Beast Statue}} along with {{C|Writhe}}.\n\n== Interactions ==\n\n=== Synergies ===\n* May allow {{R|Toy Ornithopter}} to provide its healing more often, as [[Potions]] can generally be used more liberally when {{R|White Beast Statue}} guarantees as least 1 in every combat reward.\n* All of the extra [[Potions]] will have their effects improved by {{R|Sacred Bark}}.\n\n=== Anti-Synergies ===\n* {{R|Sozu}} will render {{R|White Beast Statue}} useless.\n\n== Update History ==\n* '''Patch V2.0: The Watcher'''\n** White Beast Statue relic rarity changed from Boss -> Uncommon.\n* '''Weekly Patch 25: Building Blocks'''\n** Fixed issue where White Beast relic would still spawn on Brewmaster Daily.\n\n{{RelicNav}}\n[[Category:Relics]]"}}}]}}}}